.TH C3AVCOMPRESSOR 1 "September 2026" "0.1.0" "C3.AVcompressor Manual"
.SH NAME
c3avcompressor \- High-performance AI/NPU accelerated audio/video compressor, splitter, and extractor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B c3avcompressor
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBC3.AVcompressor\fR is developed by \fBC3net Development\fR.
It harnesses Neural Processing Units (NPUs) such as Apple Silicon Neural Engine (ANE) and Intel/AMD NPUs on Linux to perform real-time AI stream analysis, dynamic rate control (Dynamic CRF), and foveated perceptual quantization, outperforming traditional CUDA FFmpeg pipelines at a fraction of the power consumption.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBcompress\fR \-i \fIINPUT\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
Transcode and compress video and audio using NPU AI rate control and hardware encoders (VideoToolbox / VAAPI / NVENC).
.TP
\fBsplit\fR \-i \fIINPUT\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
Split or cut media streams by time ranges, segment duration, or automatic AI scene boundary detection.
.TP
\fBextract\fR \-i \fIINPUT\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
Extract audio tracks (AAC, AC3, DTS, WAV, MP3, FLAC, Opus) or video streams with lossless stream copy or AI psychoacoustic filtering.
.TP
\fBprobe\fR \-i \fIINPUT\fR [\fI--json\fR]
Inspect media streams, codecs, bitrates, channel layouts, and metadata.
.TP
\fBnpu-status\fR [\fI--json\fR]
Display detected NPU hardware, TOPS throughput capability, and hardware video encoders.
.TP
\fBbenchmark\fR [\fI--resolution 1080p|4k\fR]
Run synthetic throughput comparison between CUDA and C3.AVcompressor NPU engine.
.TP
\fBcompletions\fR \fIshell\fR
Generate shell completion scripts (bash, zsh, fish, powershell).
.SH EXAMPLES
.B Compress video to HEVC with balanced preset:
.IP
c3avcompressor compress -i raw.mov -o compressed.mp4 --video-codec hevc --preset balanced
.PP
.B Extract audio to MP3 at 320 kbps:
.IP
c3avcompressor extract -i movie.mkv -o audio.mp3 --format mp3 --bitrate 320
.PP
.B Split video losslessly at timestamp range:
.IP
c3avcompressor split -i stream.mp4 -o clip.mp4 --start 00:01:30 --end 00:05:00 --copy
.SH AUTHOR
C3net Development <https://github.com/C3net/C3.AVcompressor>
